<title>USA: Merrill capital is highest ever--chairman.</title>
<headline>Merrill capital is highest ever--chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PLAINSBORO, N.J. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co's outgoing chairman Daniel Tully said Tuesday the company has more capital now than at any point in its history.</p>
<p>Tully made the remark at the company's annual meeting in response to a shareholder question.</p>
<p>He gave no figure on the company's capital.</p>
</text>
